#: conf.json:summary
msgid "A formal semantic substrate for Luna-Flow symbolic computation, with binding, substitution, rewriting, evaluation strategies, and lambda/type-theoretic cores."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "type_theory"
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "This module provides reusable named and De Bruijn binding semantics, capture-avoiding substitution, structured single-step reduction, and bounded untyped NbE."
msgstr ""

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "Custom domain ASTs should implement `BindingSyntax` to use one-pass generic substitution and arbitrary custom rewrite rules. Lambda users may choose named syntax, De Bruijn small-step reduction, or bounded NbE with quote."
msgstr ""

